/xapp_drop_reducer\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_fairness_no_drop_loss\", \"name\": \"Fairness Guarded by Drop\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Improve fairness by reweighting per-UE scheduling while enforcing a drop-rate guardrail based on an externally provided baseline. The xApp raises weightUE for low-throughput UEs only when windowed drop ratio stays within a small rise tolerance. It may reduce throughput if fairness gains are large.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_fairness_no_drop_loss\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": {\"domain\": \"scheduling\", \"parameter\": \"weightUE\", \"semantic\": \"Per-UE scheduling weights used by the scheduler to bias PRB allocation toward fairness.\"}, \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_fairness_no_drop_loss\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_fairness_no_thr_loss\", \"name\": \"Fairness Guarded by Throughput\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Improve fairness by reweighting per-UE scheduling while enforcing a throughput guardrail based on an externally provided baseline. The xApp raises weightUE for low-throughput UEs only when windowed throughput stays within a small drop tolerance. It may increase drop ratio if fairness gains are large.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_fairness_no_thr_loss\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": {\"domain\": \"scheduling\", \"parameter\": \"weightUE\", \"semantic\": \"Per-UE scheduling weights used by the scheduler to bias PRB allocation toward fairness.\"}, \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_fairness_no_thr_loss\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_fairness_scheduler\", \"name\": \"Fairness Scheduler xApp\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Improves fairness by round-robin selection of UEs per cell. This can reduce peak throughput in exchange for more even service.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_fairness_scheduler\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": \"scheduling.selectedUE\", \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_fairness_scheduler\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_interference_mitigator\", \"name\": \"Interference Mitigator xApp\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Continuously reduces transmit power to minimize interference and reduce BLER. This can decrease throughput and increase drop ratio.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_interference_mitigator\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": \"radio.txPowerOffset_dB\", \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_interference_mitigator\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_mobility_balancer\", \"name\": \"Mobility Balancer xApp\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Aggressively advances handover timing by reducing hysteresis and time-to-trigger. This accelerates cell changes but may increase handover count and ping-pong risk.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_mobility_balancer\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": [\"handover.hysteresisOffset_dB\", \"handover.tttOffset_slot\"], \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_mobility_balancer\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_stability_guard\", \"name\": \"Stability Guard xApp\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Suppresses frequent handovers by increasing hysteresis. This improves stability but can delay cell changes.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_stability_guard\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": \"handover.hysteresisOffset_dB\", \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_stability_guard\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_throughput_maximizer\", \"name\": \"Throughput Maximizer xApp\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Maximizes throughput by selecting high-utility UEs and adaptively boosting bandwidth and power when PRB is saturated and SINR is low. Soft caps limit drop and BLER growth.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_throughput_maximizer\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": [\"scheduling.selectedUE\", \"radio.bandwidthScale\", \"radio.txPowerOffset_dB\"], \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_throughput_maximizer\", \"status\": \"off\"}]\n\n已部署策略(current.enabledXApps):\n[\"xapp_drop_reducer\", \"xapp_interference_mitigator\"]\n约束: 不要选择已经部署的xApp。\n\nreasoning需为简短中文理由，不要包含多余格式。\nkpi_focus请填写与意图相关的KPI名称列表。\n请严格输出JSON。",
